{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大号紫色标题“那些气不该忍”首先进入视线，紧接着看到同样醒目的蓝色标题“没了力气”。下方正文和右上角目录明显较弱。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。只能看出涉及某种不该忍下的情绪，以及一个已经没了力气的状态，具体处境不明确。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"无力、疲惫；是否有委屈和愤怒，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"委屈和火气仍在，还想替自己争口气；但表达这份情绪的力量正在被压力消耗。后续还有躁动不安、短暂放松却更加疲惫的变化。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两个同样醒目的大标题上下分列，需要自行建立两者之间的关系\",\n    \"放大的词本身说不清具体处境，尤其“不该忍”和“没了力气”之间的因果关系不明确\",\n    \"核心意思分散在大标题和下方正文里，需要拼接才能理解\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "43ce3058-7619-4344-abfd-c2083cf939de", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T023004274825Z", "elapsed_seconds": 16.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:30:21.233467+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f6c16b6d234f2bba6a994edda016fc4d4a039c1c238f3ae6ac5d77dc52eac6a4", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f68